## Repo map

- `plan/plan.json` — **single source of truth for all tasks** (each carries
  `owner: me|agent`, `priority: P0|P1|P2`, `status`). Edit this, then regenerate
  the dashboard.
- `dashboard/index.html` — **generated** status dashboard (open in a browser):
  "Next up" by priority + your tasks vs. agent tasks. Rebuild with
  `python src/build_dashboard.py`; never edit by hand.
- `docs/` — **sharable documents only** (things that could be handed to an
